---
const background = import.meta.glob<ImageMetadata>('../assets/Languages/*.svg', {
  eager: true,
  import: 'default',
});
---
<head>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/trafficgiant/icon.bmp" />
<style>
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    height: 100%;
  }
  body {
    background: url("/trafficgiant/traffigiant.bmp") left top / 400px 100% repeat-x fixed;
  }
  #main {
    background-color: #183B56;
    width: 50%;
    margin: 4rem auto 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  h1 {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="main">
   <h1><b>Verkehrsgigant</b></h1>
   <h2><b>Unused assets</b></h2>
   <h3>Trucks</h3>
    <p> There are a few truck assets hidden in the game files. It is possible to put them into the game and the animation works, but for now only as a replacement of a bus.</p>
   <div class="row">
      <img src="/trafficgiant/lkw1.bmp" />
      <img src="/trafficgiant/lkw2.bmp" />
      <img src="/trafficgiant/lkw3.bmp" />
      <img src="/trafficgiant/lkw4.bmp" />
    </div>
   <h2><b>Flipped suspension rail</b></h2>
   <h2><b>Magnetbahn</b></h2>
   <h2><b>Fun facts</b></h2>
   <p>London metro network background</p>
   <p>Manderl</p>
   <p>Ebensee</p>
</div>

</body>
